📖 Surah Al-Asr (Surah 103)

Makki Surah | 3 Aayaat | Ek Chhoti Surah Lekin Gehra Paighaam
Imam Shafi’i (رحمه الله) ne farmaya:
"Agar log sirf is Surah par ghoor karein to yeh unke liye kafi hoti."

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅ Ayah 1: وَالْعَصْرِ (Wal-‘Asr)

Translation: "Qasam hai waqt ki."

🔹 Allah waqt ki qasam khate hain, jo insaan ki sabse badi daulat hai.
🔹 "Asr" ke 3 ma’ani hain:

Waqt ka guzar jana – Har lamha insaan ki zindagi se nikal raha hai.
Shaam ka waqt (Asr) – Din ka woh hissa jo dobara wapas nahi aata.
Zamana / History – Puri insaaniyat ka safar.

💡 Lesson: Har pal keemat rakhta hai. Har saans akhirat ki bachat ban sakti hai ya ghaata.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅ Ayah 2: إِنَّ الْإِنسَانَ لَفِي خُسْرٍ (Innal insaana lafee khusr)

Translation: "Beshak insaan nuqsaan mein hai."

🔹 Allah ne "Inna" aur "La" dono emphasize kiye, matlab shak ki jagah hi nahi – insaan asal mein ghaate mein hai.
🔹 Nuqsaan ke pehlu:

Waqt be-guzar gaya, dobara nahi aata.
Zindagi kam hoti ja rahi hai.
Duniya ke maal aur kaam sirf duniya tak, akhirat mein sirf amal ka hisaab.

💡 Lesson: Har insaan ek shopkeeper ki tarah hai jo apni daulat (waqt, jawani, sehat) bech raha hai. Agar Allah ke liye invest na kare to ghaata hi ghaata hai.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅ Ayah 3: إِلَّا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا وَعَمِلُوا الصَّالِحَاتِ وَتَوَاصَوْا بِالْحَقِّ وَتَوَاصَوْا بِالصَّبْرِ

Translation: "Magar woh log nahi jo:
1️⃣ Imaan laaye,
2️⃣ Nek amal kiye,
3️⃣ Haq ki naseehat ki,
4️⃣ Aur sabr ki naseehat ki."

🔹 1. Iman (Faith)
Sirf zubaan se "I believe" keh dena nahi, balki yaqeen, submission aur Allah aur Rasool ﷺ ki itaat.

🔹 2. Amal-e-Saaleh (Good Deeds)
Iman ke mutabiq amal – Namaz, Roza, Zakat, Hajj, Ikhlaaq, aur gunahon se bachna.

🔹 3. Tawaasi bil-Haqq (Advising Truth)
Deen sirf personal nahi, social responsibility hai.
Haq = Qur’an, Sunnah, sach, insaf.
Har Muslim apne dosron ko yaad dilaye.

🔹 4. Tawaasi bis-Sabr (Advising Patience)
Ibadat par sabr – Namaz, roza aur ibadat ki mushkilat ko bardasht karna.
Gunah se sabr – Nafson ki khwahish aur shaitan se bachna.
Mushkilat par sabr – Imtihan, dukh, aur zulm bardasht karna.

💡 Lesson: Deen par chalna akela kaam nahi hai. Iman aur amal ke sath ek dosre ko haqq aur sabr ki yaad dilana farz hai.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌟 Detailed Summary

Surah Al-Asr insaaniyat ke liye ek life formula hai.
Allah waqt ki qasam kha kar yeh batate hain ke har insaan asal mein nuqsaan mein hai. 
Lekin kuch log bachte hain jo chaar cheezen apnate hain:

1️⃣ Iman – Allah, Qur’an, Akhirat, Nabi ﷺ par yaqeen.
2️⃣ Amal-e-Saaleh – Apne imaan ke mutabiq amal karna.
3️⃣ Haq ki da’wat – Dusron ko sach, deen aur insaf ki taraf bulana.
4️⃣ Sabr ki da’wat – Mushkilat aur ibadat mein sabr ki naseehat karna.

⚡ Agar in mein se koi bhi ek cheez missing ho to insaan ghaate mein hai. Yeh 4 pillars ek Muslim ki zindagi aur society dono ke liye zaroori hain.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🕌 Practical Daily Life Applications

Time Management: Har din kam az kam kuch waqt Qur’an aur zikr ke liye fix karo.
Iman aur Amal: Har amal check karo – kya yeh Qur’an aur Sunnah ke mutabiq hai?
Haq ki Naseehat: Family ya doston ko ek achhi baat daily share karo.
Sabr: Mushkilat mein shikayat na karo, Allah se madad aur sabr maango.

__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

📌 Key Takeaways

Waqt ki qadar karo – yeh sabse badi daulat hai.
Har insaan ghaate mein hai except woh jo 4 qualities rakhte hain.
Iman + Amal + Haq + Sabr = Success in dunya & akhirah.
Yeh Surah ek Muslim ke liye mission statement hai.
